      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "Soon after leaving the nun, we come across this small cave. 'Another bat cave?' I asked curiously. No, this is the cave into which the Khmer Rouge used to throw down small children to kill them, our guide said. Oh god! So we are upon the killing fields again! This is the third of the killing fields I have had the unfortunate honour to witness in Cambodia. (Battambang, Cambodia, Apr. 2014)",
