      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "A closer look at the mouth of the cave into which the Khmer Rouge murderers used to throw children to their deaths. I was wondering what sort of brave hearts these heartless lunatics were, to be so brave as to murder innocent young children. Makes you ashamed to even belong to the human race.  (Battambang, Cambodia, Apr. 2014)",
