    {
      "filename": "There is a shrine down there (14472875183).jpg",
      "title": "File:There is a shrine down there (14472875183).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/There_is_a_shrine_down_there_%2814472875183%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:There_is_a_shrine_down_there_(14472875183).jpg",
      "width": 4288,
      "height": 2848,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "While I was batting back my tears and the lump in my throat, my guide began to lead my other travel companions down into a large cave alongside. Here are Marom and Malim following the guide into the cave. Note the naga (serpent) shaped balustrade on both sides of the steps leading down. There is apparently a Buddhist shrine down there. (Battambang, Cambodia, Apr. 2014)",
      "dateCreated": "2014-04-01 00:00",
