      "title": "File:More skulls- I'd have liked members of the Khmer Rouge in there instead (14266048989).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/More_skulls-_I%27d_have_liked_members_of_the_Khmer_Rouge_in_there_instead_%2814266048989%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
