      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "More skulls in a steel trough kept inside the subterranean Killing Fields cave at Phnom Sampeu in Battambang. Rather than innocent civilians, I'd have loved to see the skulls of the murderous chiefs of the lunatic Khmer Rouge regime in there. (Battambang, Cambodia, Apr. 2014)",
